      "start_seconds": 145.37,
      "end_seconds": 153.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "I take rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night. I, I take valsartan, 80 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.79,
      "end_seconds": 158.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.15,
      "end_seconds": 165.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I've got high cholesterol. I've, I've had high blood pressure for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.01,
      "end_seconds": 177.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "yes high cholesterol is known to us good to have that clear. Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.35,
      "end_seconds": 187.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.61,
      "end_seconds": 218.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "okay: saturation 97 percent, pulse 77. And And blood pressure 124 over 68, temp 36.8 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.21,
      "end_seconds": 225.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
