      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.56,
      "end_seconds": 290.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.82,
      "end_seconds": 317.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "so based on the history and the examination my working impression is an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.87,
      "end_seconds": 352.73,
      "duration_seconds": 20.86,
      "text": "I'll request blood tests, it'll help with weight loss. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. The chest clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. Let's plan a check after the results are back. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
